    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"page\" id=\"page-ashwalker\">\n  <div class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"page-eyebrow\">Undead / Elemental · Ranged Control · CR 8 · XP 3,900</div>\n    <div class=\"page-title\">Ashwalker Elemental</div>\n    <div class=\"page-subtitle\">Fire elemental energy fused into a cadaverous form — the marriage of Evocation's honesty and Necromancy's persistence</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"lore-box\"><p>\"Fire is honesty made bright. The dead are honest too — they no longer pretend to have opinions about what they are. The Ashwalker is the most straightforward thing I have ever made.\" — D.C.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-block\">\n    <div class=\"sb-head\">\n      <div class=\"sb-name\">Ashwalker Elemental</div>\n      <div class=\"sb-type\">Medium undead (elemental), unaligned</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">CR 8</span><span class=\"tag\">3,900 XP</span><span class=\"tag tag-red\">Fire + Undead</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sb-body\">\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Armor Class</div><div class=\"attr-val\">14 (necrotic plating)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Hit Points</div><div class=\"attr-val\">114 (12d8 + 60)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Speed</div><div class=\"attr-val\">30 ft, fly 30 ft (hover)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"core-stats\">\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">STR</div><div class=\"cs-val\">12</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+1)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">DEX</div><div class=\"cs-val\">18</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+4)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CON</div><div class=\"cs-val\">20</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+5)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">INT</div><div class=\"cs-val\">7</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">WIS</div><div class=\"cs-val\">10</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+0)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CHA</div><div class=\"cs-val\">9</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–1)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">fire, poison; bludgeoning, piercing, slashing from nonmagical weapons</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Vulnerabilities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">cold, radiant</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Condition Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">exhaustion, grappled, paralyzed, petrified, poisoned, prone, restrained</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Senses</div><div class=\"attr-val\">darkvision 60 ft, passive Perception 10</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Special Traits</div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Illumination</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The ashwalker sheds bright light in a 30-ft radius and dim light for an additional 30 ft. Invisible creatures within bright light shed by the ashwalker are visible.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Necrotic Flame</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">Any fire damage dealt by the ashwalker is simultaneously necrotic. Creatures that are immune to fire are not necessarily immune to this necrotic component — DM adjudicates based on the source of immunity.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Anti-Plant Aura</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">Plants and plant-type creatures within 15 ft of the ashwalker that are not orthogenic wither and take 4 (1d8) fire damage at the start of each of their turns. Orthogenic plants and Corpse Orchard Nodes are unaffected.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Actions</div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Multiattack</div><p class=\"action-desc\">The ashwalker makes two Touch of Ash attacks, or one Touch of Ash and uses Ash Burst if available.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Touch of Ash</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Spell Attack:</em> +7 to hit, reach 5 ft, one target. <em>Hit:</em> 14 (3d6 + 4) fire damage plus 9 (2d8) necrotic damage. If the target is a plant or plant-type creature, it takes an additional 7 (2d6) fire damage.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Ash Burst <em>(Recharge 5–6)</em></div><p class=\"action-desc\">The ashwalker erupts in a 20-ft radius burst of necrotic flame. Each creature in the area must make a DC 16 Dexterity save, taking 35 (10d6) fire + necrotic damage on a failure, or half on a success. The ground in this area becomes covered in orthogenic ash — difficult terrain that also causes plant-type creatures to make a DC 14 Con save each round or take 7 (2d6) necrotic damage.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Extinguish the Green <em>(1/day)</em></div><p class=\"action-desc\">The ashwalker targets one area of natural plant growth within 60 ft (up to a 30-ft cube). All non-orthogenic plant life in the area is destroyed instantly. Druids who witness this must succeed on a DC 14 Wisdom save or be frightened of the ashwalker until the end of their next turn.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "public": ""
